*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0047
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 425
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0047.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> PRIOR BANKRUPTCY Y/N
    05 BKRPT-IND          PIC X.
       88 BKRPT-BANKRUPT VALUE 'Y'.
    *> YEARS SINCE BANKRUPTCY DISCHARGE
    05 BK-YEARS           PIC 9(2).
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 BUREAU-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 DECISION-CD        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 DECISION-DECLINED VALUE 'D'.
    *> DECISION REASON CODE
    05 DECLINE-RSN        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM PRIOR-BK-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "DECISION-CD=" DECISION-CD
    DISPLAY "DECLINE-RSN=" DECLINE-RSN
    STOP RUN.
PRIOR-BK-SCREEN.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF BK-YEARS < 8
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF BKRPT-BANKRUPT
        IF BK-YEARS < 10
            SET DECISION-DECLINED TO TRUE
            MOVE 'BK1' TO DECLINE-RSN
        ELSE
            MOVE 'R' TO DECISION-CD
            MOVE 'BK2' TO DECLINE-RSN
        END-IF
    END-IF.
